    "title_en": "Spin Structure of the Nucleon: Overview",
    "abstract_en": "I present a pedagogical review of the decomposition of the proton spin. Both the Jaffe-Manohar and Ji decompositions are discussed. Particular emphasis is placed on the quark and gluon orbital angular momenta, including their gauge invariant definitions, small-$x$ behavior and connection to experimental observables.",
